      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِيتَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A kind, mode,</i> or <i>manner, of death:</i>
(S, K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِيَتٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَاتَ فُلَانٌ مِيتَةً</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَسَنَةً</span> <i>Such a one died a good kind of death.</i>
(S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَاتَ مِيتَةً جَاهِلِيَّةً</span> <i>He died a pagan
